{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 0,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Most New Year's resolutions fail."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2920,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So in this video I want to talk about the science of why they fail"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6600,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and how to avoid that so your New Year's resolutions actually succeed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10640,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I want to tell you about three of my New Year's resolutions for 2020."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 15760,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The first one is to stop going to news websites"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19040,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I find I kill a ton of time by doing that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 22680,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now don't get me wrong, I do think it's important to know what's going on in the world,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26680,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I just don't think following the day-to-day developments of the news cycle is the way to do that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 31600,
    "dDurationMs": 6760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so instead I am going to get one newspaper delivered to my house every week"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 38360,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that is how I am gonna stay informed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43200,
    "dDurationMs": 5480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Research has shown it is more effective to make resolutions at new years than at any other time of the year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48680,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In fact, one study found that people who made resolutions on January 1st"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 52400,
    "dDurationMs": 6720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "were 10 times as likely to stick with them 6 months later than people who made their resolutions at other times of the year"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59120,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And January 1st 2020 is the first day of a new decade"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 62840,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so it may be even better."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 64880,
    "dDurationMs": 6760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Side note: those of you who want to argue that the first day of the decade is actually January 1st 2021,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 71640,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "while you may technically be correct because there was no year 0,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 74480,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we went straight from 1 BC to 1 AD"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 77240,
    "dDurationMs": 6040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for all intents and purposes psychologically this January 1st is the first day of the 2020s"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 83280,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that is what matters."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85240,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the technicalities I think, are unimportant. Abd this argument should be put to bed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 89840,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The 2020s start on Jan 1"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92700,
    "dDurationMs": 5220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But now the bad news: even a resolution made at New Year's will most likely fail"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 97920,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is why gyms are packed in January, but they start to clear out by March"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 102560,
    "dDurationMs": 7360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what research has found that only around 8% of people can stick with their resolutions through the end of the year"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 109920,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So why is this? And, how do we avoid that trap?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 114720,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think it all starts with a misconception"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120360,
    "dDurationMs": 5080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh no, oh no, oh no, oooooh no."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 125440,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Foooget. *sigh*"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 128160,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well this was going part of the video where I ran on the treadmill but the treadmill's just broken"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133400,
    "dDurationMs": 6640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so I think the misconception is, that people think that in order to make big changes in their lives"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 140040,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that they have to make some sort of really big effort"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 143640,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean let's say your goal was to run a marathon"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 146360,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you might plan on running ten kilometers three times a week"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 150440,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that seems kind of proportionate to the end goal"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 153360,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you might be excited and really motivated to do it for the first few weeks"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 157920,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but at some point that motivation is gonna lag"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 162280,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and running 10k is gonna seem too hard"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 164560,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so you're gonna sort of fall back into old habits"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 167440,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the misconception is thinking you need to go big,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 170040,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so being over ambitious with your goals and then not being able to commit and stick to them"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176400,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm gonna fix this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 177680,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The truth is you're much better off if you pick small targets that you can hit consistently"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 182520,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that's the idea behind James Clear's book \"Atomic Habits\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 186120,
    "dDurationMs": 8560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is this idea that if you can get just 1% better every day at something, it will take a minimum amount of effort"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 194680,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but over time the effects will compound just like compound interest"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 200360,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and James Clear proposes the two-minute rule:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 203080,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "'pick something that you can do in just two minutes'"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 205760,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you want to run a marathon, start by say running two minutes a day"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 209760,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that is something that you can't say you don't have time for"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 212680,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and once that habit sticks, well then you can try to extend it into something more ambitious"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 219400,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the next problem with resolutions is they are too often vague"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 223120,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the most common resolutions that people make are to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 226040,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "lose weight, exercise more, and to eat better."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 229320,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the problem is those things are so nondescript that it's hard to know if you're making progress"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 234520,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it's really easy to regress into your old habits"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 238080,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so the science around this says you need to be specific"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 241560,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "AND, write down your goals"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 244600,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "people who write down their goals are 40% more likely to achieve them"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 248840,
    "dDurationMs": 5320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that is pretty significant just by taking that step of putting pen to paper"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 254160,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I'm thinking here in this video you should put your New Year's resolutions in the comments"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 258320,
    "dDurationMs": 5320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because at least that is taking a step towards committing yourself to a goal for the year"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 266440,
    "dDurationMs": 7720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My second new year's resolution for 2020 is to write in a daily planner every day of this year"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 274160,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In fact I can be more specific than that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 276920,
    "dDurationMs": 5720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Um, I will write one word in this book each day"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 282640,
    "dDurationMs": 6680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "now I know one word might seem unhelpfully ridiculously little to write in this book"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 289320,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I want to commit to this idea of starting small"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 293360,
    "dDurationMs": 7360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with the idea that if I get in the habit of making the time to at least write down one word on each one of these pages,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 300720,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "well then maybe some days I will write more than one word"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 303400,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that will be helpful in terms of planning my day a little bit"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 306800,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so hopefully I will be more productive than I would have been otherwise"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 311160,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then it's really important to track your progress in an obvious and visual way"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 315760,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I'm going to use the everyday calendar by Simone Giertz"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 327640,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oddly satisfying."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 329160,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Where there's a button for every day of the year"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 332560,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you can push it and the light turns on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 335280,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that is really satisfying"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 337680,
    "dDurationMs": 9120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so I think this will encourage me to write down a word early in the day so that I can go and turn on the light for that day"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 346800,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what's great about this is it's a very visual way to track my progress"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 351200,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and to have it in an obvious place where I can look at it all the time"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 354800,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I'll put it in the back of shot for some of my videos in 2020"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 358080,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so you guys can see how I'm progressing towards this goal"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 361960,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so the third major problem with New Year's resolutions is that people seem to think"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 366440,
    "dDurationMs": 5880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's about having more willpower or motivation, being able to resist temptation better"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 372320,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but willpower is a finite resource"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 375200,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it can be depleted that there are gonna be some bad days and that is when you're gonna relapse"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 380600,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so relying on willpower is not an effective strategy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 383960,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and research has shown that people who have better self-control"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 387640,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "actually just have to exercise it less"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 391000,
    "dDurationMs": 6680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the way they're able to do that is by structuring their environments so they don't have to exercise their willpower"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 397680,
    "dDurationMs": 6720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I find in my kitchen it's always like the treats and snacks which are left out on the counter"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 404400,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the veggies which are like tucked away in the vegetable crisper drawer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 409560,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I get it because you know that's where the veggies are meant to go to keep them crisp,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 414160,
    "dDurationMs": 5080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the problem is if I don't see them, if they're not in my line of sight, I will just end up eating what's on the counter"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 419240,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and not going digging for veggies"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 422240,
    "dDurationMs": 6960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so we need a way of changing our environments so that we make better choices"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 429200,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which brings me to my third and final new year's resolution for 2020:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 433160,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I am deleting social media apps off of my phone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 437280,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm getting rid of Instagram and Twitter. You are watching the exact moment that I do that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 442480,
    "dDurationMs": 5320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the reason for this is I find I just kill way too much time going into these apps"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 447800,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and research shows that any tiny distraction that you have during your day"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 452560,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "takes you you know something like 20,25 minutes to get back into your work"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 457280,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so I'm losing a lot of time to just procrastinating with these apps"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 462160,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so I'm getting rid of them off my phone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 463560,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so I don't have to use my willpower to not click them mindlessly as I normally would"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 468600,
    "dDurationMs": 7280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I've actually downloaded an app that will block news sites and block my social media while I'm working"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 475880,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because that way I don't have to restrain myself"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 479760,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the systems that I put in place will restrain me for me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 483080,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I know a lot of this sounds a little bit CGP Grey"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 485840,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I think he's on to something"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 487560,
    "dDurationMs": 5800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you don't need to follow the day-to-day movements of the news cycle and you do not need to be scrolling social media all the time"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 493360,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "particularly when you're trying to get useful work done"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 495760,
    "dDurationMs": 1160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that's how I feel"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 496920,
    "dDurationMs": 7840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I want to optimize my 2020 by locking down all my potential distractions not needing any willpower,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 504760,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I've got some small, specific, and written down,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 509760,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "targeted with tracking plans for 2020"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 513160,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so I'd love to know what you're planning for 2020 for your New Year's resolutions"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 518080,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What are your plans for the next decade?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 524880,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hey! this episode of Veritasium is supported by viewers like you on Patreon and by Audible"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 529880,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know what's an excellent habit? Listening to one audiobook every month"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 533960,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and as an Audible member, that's easy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 536400,
    "dDurationMs": 6800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because each month you get one credit good for any audiobook regardless of price from Audible's huge selection"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 543200,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now a couple of the audiobooks I have on my phone are atomic habits by James Clear,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 548120,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and Deep Work by Cal Newport"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 550480,
    "dDurationMs": 5640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I was re-listening to these books recently when I was taking my kids out for nap drives"
    } ]
  }, {
